### Findings on Gaza by the courts and human rights bodies

In January 2024 the International Court of Justice found it plausible that Israel's conduct in Gaza
violates the Genocide Convention and ordered provisional measures requiring Israel to prevent
genocidal acts. In November 2024 the International Criminal Court issued arrest warrants for Benjamin
