## 7. What Avik Jain offers Anthropic, and what he asks for in return

Avik Jain was first author on value-alignment research in Anca Dragan's InterACT lab at Berkeley, with
Lawrence Chan and Dragan as co-authors. He declined offers from Jane Street and OpenAI to build his
own system, and has spent ten years on a proof-carrying computing substrate in which the cost of a
